..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : SERHISTORIE.EV
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Allgemeine Events fuer Infosystem SERHISTORIE
.. Functionality  : General events for infosystem SERHISTORIE
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. event evaluation
.. ----------- ----- Kopfteil ------ -------------------------------------------
.continue SERPROD ? T|evtartengl = "FIELD_EXIT"    & T|evtvar = "kprodukt"
.. ----------- ---------- ---------- -------------------------------------------
.continue END
..
!SERPROD: service product
.formula M|kartikel   = M|kprodukt^artikel^id
.formula M|kkunde     = M|kprodukt^kunde^id
.formula M|kaukunde   = M|kprodukt^aukunde^id
.assign M|kcharge  = M|kprodukt^charge^id
.assign M|kexnum   = M|kprodukt^charge^exnum
.assign M|keignr   = M|kprodukt^eignr
.continue TABINIT
..
!TABINIT: a key field was changed, remove old rows
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
.continue END
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
